MINIKUBE:
First launch an EC2 instance in AWS with following configurations:
Amazon Linux AMI
c7i-flex.large instance type. WHY?
Official minikube website says minikube installation requires 2cpus, 2gb of free memory and 200gb of free disk space. Hence c7i-flex.large
Select or create a key pair
Select or create a security group(22 Port is enough)
28 GB of ebs volume and Launch.

Connect to the instance via SSH
And install docker since minikube need one container manager tool.
